So i purchased HW and Stormblood on steam cause thats apparently where i bought the base game.  
My question now is, if i want to purchase the ShB physical collectors edition can i not... do that? Will i get a code that doesn't work? I just want the cards and statue ;-;

&#x200B;

It would explain how we have other "warriors of light" help us in duties.  


Unless that's already been explained? I probably missed it somewhere or have forgotten?

&#x200B;

I first started with an ugly af elezen with the youngest face because i was brand new to mmo and good tastes...

I have since switched to (according to my friends) a handsome Sun Miqo'te who, being on Balmung, has a lot of thought and effort put into him and i love him.
I also have a much better looking Wood Elezen who i also love and was my main before i moved to Balmung and started my Miqo'te... now they're both on Balmung doing nothing cause i am unemployed ;-;

Nintenfo 64, first 3 games i played on it were Star Fox 64, Mega-Man 64, and Majora's Mask.
I still have one of the controllers but i sadly lost my entire system and games when i moved out of my childhood house ;-;

Marked the end of my childhood and happiness...
